        "TileImage": "$($repository 8ffe3261-869c-4557-b24e-c9b62e313fbd).Image",
        "Description": "Gilbert Pichler once again snuck in and hacked my favorite apricot muffin. This time he&apos;s in conspiracy with agent swan and other 2 accomplices disguised as club staff and turn it into a proximity muffin bomb.\rOnce this gets in the hand of Jiao, apricot muffin will be banned in Germany.Eliminate Gilbert with blueberry muffin and other staffs in accidents.\rGood lick and hunting 47.",
